sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor System as System
participant HealthStartupInterface as Boundary: HealthStartupInterface
participant WorkloadMigrationControl as Control: WorkloadMigrationControl
participant SchemaMigration as Entity: SchemaMigration
System->>HealthStartupInterface: Start service or submit bounded work
HealthStartupInterface->>WorkloadMigrationControl: Acquire lock and enforce capacity
WorkloadMigrationControl->>SchemaMigration: Read migration and workload state
SchemaMigration-->>WorkloadMigrationControl: Return recorded checksums and availability
WorkloadMigrationControl-->>HealthStartupInterface: Apply pending work transactionally
HealthStartupInterface-->>System: Report safe readiness or retry
